    <tr><td>4 · Interactions (the cut)</td><td><strong>Cut on assertability</strong>: gate deterministic post-interaction states (focus / <code>aria-*</code> flips / loading-error) now via the boolean floor; motion/timing/prototype-feel stays advisory</td><td>Figma prototypes advisory · Storybook <code>play</code> = deterministic post-event assertion · ratified oracle-tightness B (gate boolean-deterministic; perceptual advisory) · a11y states are the highest-value deterministic checks</td></tr>
